  "hidden": false,
  "markdown": "#### Binary & Hex\n\n• 1 Hex Digit = 4 bits - Nibble；2 Hex Digits = 8 bits - Byte\n\n  ◦ Binary ↔ Hex：每 4 bits 一组\n\n• Number Prefix：0x - Hex (16)；0b - Binary (2)；Decimal (10) - No Prefix\n\n• Decimal → Binary：优先用 2 的次幂组合；也可连续除以 2 取余，倒序读余数\n\n• Parity：Even - LSB=0；Odd - LSB=1\n",
